{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/d14fc1a8f9d44e7c1ed6ef80eb145747.avif?t=1771261802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras_big/d14fc1a8f9d44e7c1ed6ef80eb145747.avif?t=1771261802 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up aboard <i>The Orpheus</i>, a derelict warship lost in deep space and crawling with horrors. No memory. Only the instinct to fight and a voice urging you forward. The ship shifts around you, the enemies never stop, and survival means battling through blood-soaked corridors to uncover what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a haunting, low-poly world with crunchy pixel textures, Moros Protocol blends fast-paced combat of classic '90s and early 2000s FPS games, the unpredictability of genre-defining roguelites, and the challenge of Souls-like boss fights. Battle relentless enemies and towering nightmares in a brutal test of skill and willpower. With procedurally generated levels, evolving threats, and intense action, survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship is a war zone. The enemy is endless. The odds are against you. <br>You may be outnumbered, but you are not outmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/35ed649683252102354927f6c84310d9.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/35ed649683252102354927f6c84310d9.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/35ed649683252102354927f6c84310d9.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aTACTICAL FPS COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moros Protocol</i> combines relentless action with adaptability and customization. Shape your loadout and let the augments and weapons you find dictate your fighting style. And yes, you can kick your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/68cad9b15f6756b6aa70894c10400346.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/68cad9b15f6756b6aa70894c10400346.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/68cad9b15f6756b6aa70894c10400346.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aROGUELIKE PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning. Learn, upgrade, and push further into the unknown. Each run is shaped by a combination of handcrafted environments and procedural generation. New layouts. New challenges to face. No two runs will feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/4de81cc1aff1d073fdb81c813959df61.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/4de81cc1aff1d073fdb81c813959df61.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/4de81cc1aff1d073fdb81c813959df61.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aUNIQUE CUSTOM RENDERER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gritty, immersive world that blends retro aesthetics with modern rendering, creating a decayed sci-fi atmosphere.\u00a0 Dynamic lighting and eerie sound design heighten the tension as you explore the abandoned warship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/5377eb9176c8aed0524b9700e8bf5a23.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/5377eb9176c8aed0524b9700e8bf5a23.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/5377eb9176c8aed0524b9700e8bf5a23.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aDROP-IN CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend for backup. Adapt and survive together as you battle through the nightmare. Experience the full game side by side, sharing the fight against the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Message from <i>Pixel Reign</i>: <i>Moros Protocol has been a passion project that started back in 2010 as a concept, which we have been working on for the last 5 years to bring it to life. We are really excited to finally be able to share our vision with you and hope you enjoy it as much as we've enjoyed making it.</i><br><br>Moros Protocol is inspired by some amazing games: DOOM, System Shock, Binding of Isaac, and many other amazing retro-futuristic first-person shooters. Check them out too if you have not already!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome aboard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/56dfed6a5c9b79a0d1756b81ecddd1543259dc05.jpg"},{"name":"Just a humble beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/f469ee470eac8048b88128e67dc74033638274c7.jpg"},{"name":"Almost there","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/8a4a0cd5f97eee9391de85b546a4d62c16f1d5c2.jpg"},{"name":"Epilogue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/0248b3b469aa0680c20cb44d60cf5b215f9cd9bc.jpg"},{"name":"Is it dead...?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/405e60887e484731a92dcd3d45adefcacc7a3737.jpg"},{"name":"Nemesis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/7c3d91ecc03384a418a86f7c2b7f19ad9c84207c.jpg"},{"name":"Motherless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/c992b2325f06de6657f99b1ec5a656d96d461e06.jpg"},{"name":"Bug free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/14315aa379317587ce957f9969bfd83c9fa451ff.jpg"},{"name":"Mercyful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/206fff079ebb5e3af37e335c0e7060222b303e8e.jpg"},{"name":"Change of heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1605250/b6dfaae6bcbc957caea08f013a9d2d441fdd30ae.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1605250?t=1771261802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771261802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/68f7b128c5487c8cfce83521bb3d9ed9f21c70a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771261802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/68f7b128c5487c8cfce83521bb3d9ed9f21c70a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771261802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that is not appropriate for all ages: Frequent violence, and gore"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/d14fc1a8f9d44e7c1ed6ef80eb145747.avif?t=1771261802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras_big/d14fc1a8f9d44e7c1ed6ef80eb145747.avif?t=1771261802 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up aboard <i>The Orpheus</i>, a derelict warship lost in deep space and crawling with horrors. No memory. Only the instinct to fight and a voice urging you forward. The ship shifts around you, the enemies never stop, and survival means battling through blood-soaked corridors to uncover what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a haunting, low-poly world with crunchy pixel textures, Moros Protocol blends fast-paced combat of classic '90s and early 2000s FPS games, the unpredictability of genre-defining roguelites, and the challenge of Souls-like boss fights. Battle relentless enemies and towering nightmares in a brutal test of skill and willpower. With procedurally generated levels, evolving threats, and intense action, survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ship is a war zone. The enemy is endless. The odds are against you. <br>You may be outnumbered, but you are not outmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/35ed649683252102354927f6c84310d9.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/35ed649683252102354927f6c84310d9.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/35ed649683252102354927f6c84310d9.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aTACTICAL FPS COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moros Protocol</i> combines relentless action with adaptability and customization. Shape your loadout and let the augments and weapons you find dictate your fighting style. And yes, you can kick your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/68cad9b15f6756b6aa70894c10400346.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/68cad9b15f6756b6aa70894c10400346.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/68cad9b15f6756b6aa70894c10400346.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aROGUELIKE PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning. Learn, upgrade, and push further into the unknown. Each run is shaped by a combination of handcrafted environments and procedural generation. New layouts. New challenges to face. No two runs will feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/4de81cc1aff1d073fdb81c813959df61.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/4de81cc1aff1d073fdb81c813959df61.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/4de81cc1aff1d073fdb81c813959df61.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aUNIQUE CUSTOM RENDERER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gritty, immersive world that blends retro aesthetics with modern rendering, creating a decayed sci-fi atmosphere.\u00a0 Dynamic lighting and eerie sound design heighten the tension as you explore the abandoned warship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/5377eb9176c8aed0524b9700e8bf5a23.poster.avif?t=1771261802\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/5377eb9176c8aed0524b9700e8bf5a23.webm?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/extras/5377eb9176c8aed0524b9700e8bf5a23.mp4?t=1771261802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3aDROP-IN CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend for backup. Adapt and survive together as you battle through the nightmare. Experience the full game side by side, sharing the fight against the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Message from <i>Pixel Reign</i>: <i>Moros Protocol has been a passion project that started back in 2010 as a concept, which we have been working on for the last 5 years to bring it to life. We are really excited to finally be able to share our vision with you and hope you enjoy it as much as we've enjoyed making it.</i><br><br>Moros Protocol is inspired by some amazing games: DOOM, System Shock, Binding of Isaac, and many other amazing retro-futuristic first-person shooters. Check them out too if you have not already!</p>","developers":["Pixel Reign"],"dlc":[3916220],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605250/header.jpg?t=1771261802","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Moros Protocol \u00a9 Developed by Pixel Reign. Published by Super Rare Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1605250/1505636765/dc602c098d74e65d1e3c80f57c172f7f1685669a/1757064573/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758213002","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1605250/1505636765/dc602c098d74e65d1e3c80f57c172f7f1685669a/1757064573/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758213002","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1605250/1505636765/dc602c098d74e65d1e3c80f57c172f7f1685669a/1757064573/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758213002","id":257193593,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193593/ece07ae